@startuml
!include ../../_common/style.puml
title L2：Pulsar 普通消息发送与 Shared 消费

participant MessageTemplate
participant PulsarMessageProvider as Provider
participant PulsarProducer as Producer
queue PulsarBroker as Broker
participant "Shared Consumer" as Consumer
participant CoreListener

== 发送 ==
MessageTemplate -> Provider: send(request)
Provider -> Provider: newMessage().value(body)
opt messageKey 存在
  Provider -> Provider: key(messageKey)
end
Provider -> Provider: properties(headers)
Provider -> Producer: sendAsync()
Producer -> Broker: publish
Broker --> Producer: MessageId / error
Producer --> Provider: completion
Provider --> MessageTemplate: standardized result

== 消费 ==
Broker -> Consumer: Message<byte[]>
Consumer -> Provider: messageListener
Provider -> CoreListener: onMessage(inbound)
alt SUCCESS
  CoreListener --> Provider: SUCCESS
  Provider -> Consumer: acknowledgeAsync(message)
  alt ACK 异常
    Consumer --> Provider: exception
    Provider -> Consumer: negativeAcknowledge(message)
  end
else RETRY / exception
  CoreListener --> Provider: RETRY
  Provider -> Consumer: negativeAcknowledge(message)
end

note over Provider
Shared Subscription 不承诺同 key 顺序。
Key_Shared、事务和精确重投治理属于后续阶段。
end note
@enduml
